WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
Don't worry, just leave the selling to me.

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:02,880
Definitely not a loss

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,920
Maybe I can harvest 200 gold coins today

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:08,360
It may not even be possible to hit three hundred gold coins

5
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,920
Three hundred gold coins every day is just interest

6
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:12,120
You can eat sixty gold coins

7
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,360
Five hundred gold coins to upgrade talent

8
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:19,330
It's only two hundred short, Captain.

9
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:21,930
This Liannu paired with my talent of hitting every target is invincible.

10
00:00:22,090 --> 00:00:23,970
Gentleman, you are so confused.

11
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:25,650
Even if this lotus slave is useful to you

12
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:28,770
We can't just spend ten gold coins to buy it. Our family is too rich.

13
00:00:28,770 --> 00:00:30,210
How can I be so shocked?

14
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:32,770
Yes, gentleman, you are too impulsive.

15
00:00:32,850 --> 00:00:34,250
I was afraid of being snatched away by others

16
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:35,450
I placed the order with a trembling hand.

17
00:00:35,570 --> 00:00:39,490
Captain Chen, I'm sorry. I was reckless.

18
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:41,850
Come and see what simple things Lian Nu is using.

19
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:43,170
If there is nothing to add

20
00:00:43,370 --> 00:00:49,700
The value of this Lian slave is greatly reduced, Captain

21
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,420
I saw that seller meeting Lian Nu again
